From 2aafba7eb0098f9723846976a891807f80bcf002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:18:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): judge the stated shank below a holder foot drawn
 beside it

Keep HolderProfile::enclose conservative for single-cylinder fallback
laws while switching its interval overlap to strict interior bounds so
bands touching only shank_top do not widen shank_d (#2180).

Split the shank span against holder bands inside neck::shank_with_body
and feed the result through operation::tool_gate::job_tool and
fixture_struck::op_hits so 3D pocket reach, verify, fixture checks, and
the post gate judge the stated shank below the holder foot and the
holder band from its foot upward.

Fixes #2199
